<title>MALAYSIA: Commerce Asset warrants fixed at 7.45 rgt.</title>
<headline>Commerce Asset warrants fixed at 7.45 rgt.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Commerce Asset-Holding Bhd said it has fixed the exercise price of its warrants at 7.45 ringgit a share.</p>
<p>In a statement issued by its merchant bankers, the financial services firm said the price was based on the weighted average market price of its shares for five market days prior to the May 7 price-fixing date.</p>
<p>Around 0225 GMT, Commerce Asset shares were at 15.60, up 10 cents.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsrroom (603-206 2323)</p>
</text>
